{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：12:57 2026-09-08 HKT<br/>發佈時間：12:57 2026-09-08 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：12:57 2026-09-08 HKT</p><p>今(8日)早上10時48分，一部路線77K九巴在粉錦公路行駛期間，撞到路旁一棵樹的樹幹，九巴車頭擋風玻璃爆裂，車內一名女乘頸及背被玻璃碎濺傷，送院敷治。被撞的樹幹部分損毀，警方正調查事件。</p><img alt=\"警員到場調查。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/394ef5d008fd145cc1a08eba48479622/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-08_at_12_15_16_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/dbdbf936e2364fede99b9075a6162dad/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-08_at_12_15_16.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"部分樹幹被撞毀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4cf0b9b4bf93527b9cbce887bcb9b0c4/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-08_at_12_15_15_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"被撞爛的樹幹。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/253e06f7e6f595871f1a2a87d84c7e88/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-08_at_12_15_15_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3214b540c4a183112386c74196da9100/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-08_at_12_15_15.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"樹幹被撞毀。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a8740ac902188620e8c0851d4558058e/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-08_at_12_15_14.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-08T05:18:00.898825+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":177,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}